  "balance_notes": [
    "Magmar is the most expensive pack — average shell cost is ~9-12. Needs gold ramp before deploying.",
    "Grimrock (cost 6) is the only true budget pick; place 2 early to bridge to the heavy units.",
    "Dreadnaught at 224 range + 72 splash is the carry. Place dead-center, surround with Ankylos.",
    "Brundlbeast is melee but hits like an assassin — pairs with Aymara Healer (Vetruvian) for an aura burst combo.",
    "Primal Growth relic snowballs hard if early units survive. Don't sell early picks.",
    "Extinction Event wave is intentionally Magmar-mirror: you need anti-regen (Vanar shatter, Lyonar pierce) imported from another pack to break the tank's regen + hp scaling."
  ]
